<title>UK: Asian Development Bank prices $1.0 bln global bond.</title>
<headline>Asian Development Bank prices $1.0 bln global bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following global bond has been priced, joint lead managers Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi, Goldman Sachs and SBC Warburg said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The deal was launched overnight in the Asian session.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ASIAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT	  $1.0 BLN  COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    11.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.427    PAY DATE    11.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.325     REOFFER    99.427    SPREAD	+18 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX/HK/SI PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.625 PERCENT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 15.MAY.07 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
